## 🚀 QUICK START

### Monolith (All-in-One):
```bash
npm install
npm run typeorm migration:run
npm run start:dev
open http://localhost:3000/api/docs
```

### Microservices (Scalable):
```bash
docker-compose -f infrastructure/compose/microservices.production.yml up -d
open http://localhost:3000/api/docs
```

